{"unit_id":"mqhe2007__dsh-pm#feature-requirements","repo":"mqhe2007/dsh-pm","commit":"e1db9ebe29fd30701d0bc327df7800a4eeec2481","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pm 的功能「requirements」：创建、查看、筛选和更新 ChunSun 项目需求，也能列出需求关联的 Run。Agent 通过对应的 chunsun_requirement_* 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:53","src/tools.ts:59","src/tools.ts:184"]}
{"unit_id":"mqhe2007__dsh-pm#feature-runs","repo":"mqhe2007/dsh-pm","commit":"e1db9ebe29fd30701d0bc327df7800a4eeec2481","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pm 的功能「runs」：为需求启动或接管 Run、查看状态并记录执行 Step；completed 状态交由平台验收门禁处理。由 chunsun_run_* 与 chunsun_step_* 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:64","src/tools.ts:95"]}
{"unit_id":"mqhe2007__dsh-pm#feature-acceptance","repo":"mqhe2007/dsh-pm","commit":"e1db9ebe29fd30701d0bc327df7800a4eeec2481","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pm 的功能「acceptance」：维护需求验收场景和用例，查询状态并回写执行结果，帮助 Agent 跟踪验收闭环。通过 chunsun_scenario_* 和 chunsun_case_* 工具调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:108","src/tools.ts:114","src/tools.ts:127"]}
{"unit_id":"mqhe2007__dsh-pm#feature-panel","repo":"mqhe2007/dsh-pm","commit":"e1db9ebe29fd30701d0bc327df7800a4eeec2481","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pm 的功能「panel」：在 DSH Web 会话显示当前需求、Run 轮次和 Step 数，并提供项目总览及连接配置视图。状态条和项目管理视图由对应会话插槽注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:609","src/client/index.ts:614"]}
{"unit_id":"mqhe2007__dsh-pm#caveat-connection","repo":"mqhe2007/dsh-pm","commit":"e1db9ebe29fd30701d0bc327df7800a4eeec2481","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pm 需要连接配置的春笋 API；API URL 与项目密钥从工作区 .env 读取或由界面保存，未配置密钥时无法绑定项目。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:44","src/index.ts:48","src/index.ts:49"]}
